#. §2: `h.left`
#. §3: `x ∈ A`
#: Game/Levels/Inter/L03inter_sub_left.lean:26
msgid ""
"You probably used a step like §0 in this proof.  That step is\n"
"actually optional.  Writing out the definition of intersection probably helps *you*\n"
